  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IPU 2025 grant for Promoting Inclusive and Represe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contribution to the Inter-Parliamentary Union&#x2019;s (IPU) aims to support IPU&#x2019;s &#x2018;Promoting Inclusive and Representative Parliaments&#x2019; programme. The programme seeks to enhance gender representation through research and data-collection activity on women and youth representation, and participation in parliaments, as well as monitoring developments and emerging trends, identifying good practices and disseminating knowledge products. The programme further aims to enhance women&#x2019;s access to parliament through support for national gender-sensitive self-assessments and the work of women caucuses and initiatives to address the rollback of women&#x2019;s reproductive rights and violence against women in parliament.</narrative>
  </description>
